{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/technology' data-target='computer\/technology' data-title='Technology'>\r\n\t\t\tTechnology\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/technology\/hardware' data-target='computer\/technology\/hardware' data-title='Hardware'>\r\n\t\t\tHardware\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Intel HD Audio front-panel header versus AC'97: jack sensing and the 10-pin pinout.","label":"Front Audio","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tStandard: Intel HD Audio.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Difference from AC'97<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAC'97 has no jack sensing. Intel HD has jack sensing.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDetection: normally open.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Pinout<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMic.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t| Pin | Signal | Pin | Signal | |-----|--------|-----|--------| | 1 | Port 1 L | 2 | GND (Ground) | | 3 | Port 1 R | 4 | Presence# (active low (\u2212)) | | 5 | Port 2 R (Speaker R) | 6 | Sense1_Return (Port 1 sense) | | 7 | Sense_Send (Sense) | 8 | Key (empty) | | 9 | Port 2 L (Speaker L) | 10 | Sense2_Return (Port 2 sense) |\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMic bias is listed with the mic pins.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>Sense_Send<\/code> default open \u2014 i.e. when no jack. Can return to any one of port 6 or 10.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/en.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Intel_High_Definition_Audio#Front_panel_connector\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/hardware\/front_audio\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/technology\/hardware\/front_audio\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/technology\/hardware' data-target='computer\/technology\/hardware' data-title='Hardware'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/technology\/hardware.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Hardware<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}